  }, {
    "id" : "8fb36c7f",
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Palette as custom properties: deep sea blue, sandstone, terracotta accent; the text/background pairs are chosen at ≥ 4.5:1. Fluid type with "
